      "description": "Get inspired and make the most of your home. Discover new products, visualise your dream space and enjoy easier shopping — from anywhere. \n\nFind more than you'd imagine in the IKEA app:\n\n•\tDiscover offers, new product launches and personalised recommendations\n•\tSave your favourite products to lists, so you can find everything in one place\n•\tFind your way through the store with easy-to-follow navigation\n•\tCollect points to unlock and enjoy rewards\n•\tScan as you shop in-store and enjoy a faster checkout\n•\tDesign your dream kitchen with interactive planners\n•\tScan your room and add products to visualise them in your space\n•\tEnjoy speedy and secure payments when you shop in the app\n•\tTrack and manage your order from anywhere\n•\tCheck availability and get notified when an product is back in stock\n•\tFind digital receipts and purchase history in one place\n•\tCheck busy store times and prepare for your next visit\n•\tWatch IKEA Live and get tips from our interior design experts\n\nSome features may not be available in every country, but they are planned for release. We recommend keeping the IKEA app updated so you can experience new features when they're available.\n\nWe value your data privacy and believe in ethical use of customer data. That's why you're in control of your data at all times.",
